    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "He has not answered the query that unless an  policy is revoked whether it will stop having any impact becaus  policy as contained in Annexure P/3, there is no reference to t  1894.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 456,
      "end": 637,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Paragraph Nos.4.1 & 4.2 runs as under:-\n 4.1",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 638,
      "end": 684,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "The repealed Land Acquisition Act, 1894 d  not have detailed and exhaustive provisions regardi  the rehabilitation and resettlement.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 685,
      "end": 817,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Land Acquisition Act, 1894",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 698,
          "end": 724
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "Thus, there wa  felt need to draft a model policy for the same.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 818,
      "end": 881,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "So   the Government had drafted and promulgated the Mode  Rehabilitation Policy of Madhya Pradesh, 2002.",
